{
  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "kime Isaias w\u00e6s gehaten sum halig witega on \u00f0\u00e6ra kininga timan, swa swa us ky\u00f0 seo boc. Se witegode be Criste swi\u00f0e gewislice, swilce he godspellere w\u00e6re, swi\u00f0e gewyrdelice, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 on Efne m\u00e6den sceal geeacnian & oncennan sunu & his nama bi\u00f0 geciged God sylf ys mid us. Eft se ylca witega awrat on his gesetnysse: Puer natus est nobis & filius datus est nobis, & reliqua: Vs His boc ys swi\u00f0e micel & menigfeald be Criste & be Godes m\u00e6r\u00f0e, be eallum mancinne on gastlicum He bodode geleafan on Iudea lande & unriht forbead, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se re\u00f0a kyning, Mannases gehaten, Hieremias se witega w\u00e6s on \u00feam lande swi\u00f0e halig witega fram his cildhade; be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 God sylf He wunode on cl\u00e6nnysse, & he awrat ane boc \u00feurh \u00feone Halgan Gast on his witegunge, micele & He wear\u00f0 oft gebend & gebroht on cweartern for his halgan lare, & he heofode micclum \u00fe\u00e6s folces Plato se u\u00f0wita & se wisosta mann on h\u00e6\u00f0enum folce h\u00e6fde hine gesprecen, & se witega \u00fea hine Ezechiel se witega wear\u00f0 gehergod mid \u00feam folce, \u00fea \u00fea se Chaldeisca kining acwealde \u00f0a Iudeiscan & Ezechiel \u00f0a on \u00feeowte \u00fe\u00e6r wunode & witegode \u00fe\u00e6r, & awrat ane boc micele on gesetnisse be \u00feam Daniel se witega wunude on Chaldea, wur\u00f0full \u00feam ciningum, & awrat ane",
